  "included_scope": "Own CamillaDSP sound extension, standalone shared EQ kernel and finite upstream integration/build/probe tooling; external upstream pinned, real verification/runtime data omitted.",
  "limitations": [
    "Pinned upstream CamillaDSP archive and Cargo crates are external dependencies; their sources/binaries are not bundled. The unchanged prepare.py verifies upstream SHA256 before applying its finite patch.",
    "Own sound module, EQ kernel and baseline fixture are complete; no Pi deployment, private hardware profile, gateway service or Android app is included.",
    "Historical verification and real PCM/runtime material are excluded. Local core tests do not prove Pi load, actual DAC/ALSA continuity, acoustic behavior or installed deployment identity.",
    "Probe scripts require aiohttp (the project Gateway pins 3.14.4); they start explicitly selected isolated loopback/file Camilla processes only when the user invokes them. They are not run during packaging."
  ],
